&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;作者：&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608518654&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;em&gt;且听，这是来自大唐的末曲。&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;狂风，啸纸喷墨-艺术作品合集&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
